{"text":"Let me start off, as I said, in no particular order to highlight where we are in some of these big challenges. First of all, there's the issue of technology and the risk of the jobless underclass. A problem that has continued to really become more and more entrenched, the World Economic Forum had estimated before the pandemic that approximately 85 million jobs would be displaced over the next decade because of automation. Clearly this problem has been accelerated. We're looking at labor participation rates having already trending downwards, certainly in places like the United States after the financial crisis continuing to become problematic. This is the number of people who are actively looking for work and in the workplace continue to decline in the period post the pandemic.","words":[{"text":"Let","start":0.7,"end":0.96},{"text":"me","start":0.96,"end":1.14},{"text":"start","start":1.14,"end":1.48},{"text":"off","start":1.48,"end":1.76,"punct":","},{"text":"as","start":1.8,"end":1.9},{"text":"I","start":1.9,"end":2.04},{"text":"said","start":2.04,"end":2.2,"punct":","},{"text":"in","start":2.26,"end":2.34},{"text":"no","start":2.34,"end":2.5},{"text":"particular","start":2.5,"end":2.86},{"text":"order","start":2.86,"end":3.36},{"text":"to","start":3.36,"end":3.86},{"text":"highlight","start":3.86,"end":4.26},{"text":"where","start":4.26,"end":4.7},{"text":"we","start":4.7,"end":4.84},{"text":"are","start":4.84,"end":5.1},{"text":"in","start":5.1,"end":5.34},{"text":"some","start":5.34,"end":5.52},{"text":"of","start":5.52,"end":5.62},{"text":"these","start":5.62,"end":5.78},{"text":"big","start":5.78,"end":6.04},{"text":"challenges","start":6.04,"end":6.56,"punct":"."},{"text":"First","start":8.14,"end":8.38},{"text":"of","start":8.38,"end":8.62},{"text":"all","start":8.62,"end":8.78,"punct":","},{"text":"there's","start":8.86,"end":9.04},{"text":"the","start":9.04,"end":9.16},{"text":"issue","start":9.16,"end":9.4},{"text":"of","start":9.4,"end":9.54},{